  "body": "Consider this testcase:\r\n```\r\n<img src=\"https://www.iana.org/_img/2013.1/iana-logo-header.svg\" width=\"+20\">\r\n```\r\nPer spec, this should render the same as:\r\n```\r\n<img src=\"https://www.iana.org/_img/2013.1/iana-logo-header.svg\" width=\"20\">\r\n```\r\nand does in Gecko, but not in WebKit or Blink.\r\n\r\nI haven't tested the other numerous places that use <https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-microsyntaxes.html#rules-for-parsing-dimension-values>...\r\n\r\n@domenic @annevk",
